meta {
  name: Get Session After Withdraw
  type: http
  seq: 18
}

get {
  url: {{apiUrl}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}
  body: none
  auth: none
}

assert {
  res.status: eq 200
  res.body.success: eq true
  res.body.data.slotsRemaining: eq 8
}

docs {
  Depends on **Withdraw Request - approved** having run. Mirrors **Get Session After Undo
  Approval**: `slotsTotal` is `8` (see **Sessions / Create Session**), one approval dropped
  it to `7` (**Approve Request (for withdraw test)**), and withdrawing that approved
  request should give the slot back -- `8` again. Same assertion value as the undo-approval
  check, different code path (`withdrawRequest`'s transaction, not `revertApproval`'s).
}
